Z||000009||p4n1c||02-20-2001||11:26 AM||||If you read the page, those pictures(at the geocities place) are what the new Fiero "could" look like, it looks like he photoshop'd 'em and took the rims from Tirerack.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>The writing doesn't even stand up, why replace a 300+hp V8 with a 3.0l V6?  And does GM even use a 3.0l? Usually they don't use numbers like that. They usually have a point something litre. =]  <P>Unless it had twin turbos like the Stealth('95 R/T I think was 325hp) it's not a very worthwhile replacement for the F-bodies.<P>Just my take on the page.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)||||reg||5
